1  | ∃x (P(x) ∧ ∀y (P(y) → (y=x)))
   |----
2  | | [a]
   | |----
3  | | | [b]
   | | |----
4  | | | | P(a) ∧ P(b)
   | | | |----
5  | | | | | [c] P(c) ∧ ∀y (P(y) → (y=c))
   | | | | |----
6  | | | | | P(c)                                 ∧ Elim: 5
7  | | | | | ∀y (P(y) → (y=c))                    ∧ Elim: 5
8  | | | | | P(a) → (a=c)                         ∀ Elim: 7
9  | | | | | P(b) → (b=c)                         ∀ Elim: 7
10 | | | | | P(a)                                 ∧ Elim: 4
11 | | | | | P(b)                                 ∧ Elim: 4
12 | | | | | a=c                                  → Elim: 8,10
13 | | | | | b=c                                  → Elim: 9,11
14 | | | | | b=b                                  = Intro
15 | | | | | c=b                                  = Elim: 14, 13
16 | | | | | a=b                                  = Elim: 12, 15
17 | | | | a=b                                    ∃ Elim: 1, 5-16
18 | | | (P(a) ∧ P(b)) → (a=b)                    → Intro: 4-17
19 | | ∀y ((P(a) ∧ P(y)) → (a=y))                 ∀ Intro: 3-18
20 | ∀x ∀y ((P(x) ∧ P(y)) → (x=y))                ∀ Intro: 2-19
